      "info": {
        "title": "VALSEM – talk to the team",
        "description": "VALSEM Industries (France, since 1977) protects critical equipment during transport and storage, and keeps proof of its condition over time.\n\n• ValStrong membranes (such as ValStrong TITAN) shield equipment from corrosion and damage.\n• EXA-AIR uses embedded sensors to monitor condition in real time, with continuous traceability.\n\nVALSEM works with NDTCCS as its strategic partner in Saudi Arabia.\n\nCome to the counter to see the membranes and ask how EXA-AIR could monitor your equipment.",
        "why": "Your equipment arrives, and stays, in the condition it left the factory, with sensor data to prove it: less corrosion damage in storage, fewer surprises at commissioning, and documented integrity for audits.",
        "link": "https://www.valsem.com",
        "faq": [
          {
            "q": "What kind of equipment can be protected?",
            "a": "Critical industrial equipment during transport and storage, both crated and crate-less, for sectors such as energy, nuclear, aerospace and infrastructure."
          },
          {
            "q": "How does EXA-AIR prove the condition of my equipment?",
            "a": "Sensors embedded with the protection record the conditions the equipment is exposed to, and the data is kept as a continuous, traceable record, so you can show its integrity at any time."
          },
          {
            "q": "Who do I contact in the region?",
            "a": "NDTCCS is VALSEM's strategic partner in Saudi Arabia. Talk to the team at the counter."
          }
        ]
      }
