        "title": "QYSEA FIFISH PRO W6 – underwater ROV with UT",
        "description": "An industrial underwater drone (ROV) rated to 350 m depth, with two 4K cameras, 12,000 lumens of lighting and a modular tool interface.\n\nHere it carries an ultrasonic thickness (UT) gauge to measure the steel thickness of hulls, jetties, subsea pipelines and offshore structures underwater.",
        "why": "Underwater inspections with fewer divers: safer, faster to deploy, and with video and thickness data recorded for every point, so you know the condition of submerged assets without taking them out of service.",
