            "q": "How deep can it go?",
            "a": "The FIFISH PRO W6 is rated to 350 m depth."
          },
          {
            "q": "Does it replace divers?",
            "a": "For many inspection tasks it reduces or removes the need for divers, which is safer and faster to deploy. Some intervention work may still need divers."
          },
          {
            "q": "What else can it carry?",
            "a": "Its modular interface takes different tools, such as the UT thickness gauge shown here, a gripper arm, or imaging sonar for dark and murky water."
